CafeRecomp - source-only development snapshot

Not a playable release. The title/menu can render, but full gameplay loading
and scene rendering remain unverified. Source consolidation is not a gameplay fix.

Game data, generated game code, runtime DLLs, captures, logs, personal settings,
and Git histories are deliberately excluded. No release has been published.

Supply your own North American Wii U base game, v208 update, and DLC in
game/base, game/update, and game/dlc. Run build.bat with the
Visual Studio C++ tools installed. The generator is part of the root build;
build.bat builds it if needed. No separate dependency checkout is required.
Generation and compilation require substantial disk space and time.

Bundled DolRecomp source is based on:
https://github.com/ExpansionPak/DolRecomp
commit 1bec3554ecc4817cf78319ca3d8a0669477f29fa
Local modifications to emitter.c, cpu.c, and cpu.h are included.
Cemu-derived renderer code retains its source notices and MPL license.
See SOURCE-ORIGINS and the included license files. Required source and license
filenames are preserved. The WWHD Vulkan/Metal backend has not been enabled;
its portable GX2 surface calculations are integrated into the D3D11 host.
